:"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Bj7DL3SwmYHZYqPduAsa2w","review_id":"fTzIDnCdnwFMzK2-qKQ39A","date":"2013-10-25T16:29:21","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9515249729156494,"text_excerpt":"I just wrapped up my first time ever in New Orleans. I had never been before and on my list of food items to try, I wanted a po-boy. We asked around and several locals recommended Johnny's. I had the shrimp po-boy and I was impressed. This is a real hole-in-the-wall, which I prefer. It is small and cramped though. Service was what it was. The sandwich was really tasty, the shrimp fried to a nice golden crunch and the meat still tender, and the hot sauce on the table added the perfect kick."},{"business_id":"Bj7DL3SwmYHZYqPduAsa2w","review_id":"neij31nPMZCwopHm-goSpg","date":"2011-04-12T17:48:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9471968412399292,"text_excerpt":"My only complaint about this place is how small the restaurant is specifically because it is constantly crowded. I can deal with crowd issue but at Johnny's there is just not enough space inside to stand in line, find a table, grab your order from the front, or even move to leave the restaurant. You are pretty much squeezing through spaces, stopping to check where you can get by, and using \"sorry\" and \"thank you\" to ask people if you can get through. I think Johnny's needs to a better solution such as moving their line outside to free up space in the restaurant. But with that said, the po boys here are just big and tasty. They have every po boy imaginable including your standard fried sea..."},{"business_id":"Bj7DL3SwmYHZYqPduAsa2w","review_id":"VuFTGkIDRs-1Ua3AZBQIYQ","date":"2010-03-15T16:53:52","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9454149603843689,"text_excerpt":"If you are looking for a quick bite to eat, stop by Johnny's Po-Boys. They won't disappoint. Given our short time in NOLA, we had to fit in as many meals as possible. That meant Breakfast, Brunch, Lunch, Post-Lunch, Pre-Dinner, and Dinner. Yes that's right folks, TWO DUNCHES (Lunch+Dinner = Post-Lunch and Pre-Dinner). Well Johnny's took the spot of our post-lunch and had I known that the sandwiches came so big, I would have only ordered half. I say that, but despite having a full meal about 2 hours earlier, I still killed a full sandwich. Fat Ass? So on to the Po-Boys. Large selection here to choose from. One thing should be noted, you can do a half and half. I'm not talking about their h..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Bj7DL3SwmYHZYqPduAsa2w","photo_id":"ge9QdOKVl22sGuxhHOFdmQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ge9QdOKVl22sGuxhHOFdmQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.928455114364624},{"business_id":"Bj7DL3SwmYHZYqPduAsa2w","photo_id":"G4R7i-QEO5WKAKUFs0GcjQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/G4R7i-QEO5WKAKUFs0GcjQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9003896117210388},{"business_id":"Bj7DL3SwmYHZYqPduAsa2w","photo_id":"ed2rqF3o0xKgbpkQMIRgdg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ed2rqF3o0xKgbpkQMIRgdg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8779112696647644},{"business_id":"Bj7DL3SwmYHZYqPduAsa2w","photo_id":"IylNIpDjOSWs8h6uC9vrLw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/IylNIpDjOSWs8h6uC9vrLw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8632994890213013},{"business_id":"Bj7DL3SwmYHZYqPduAsa2w","photo_id":"SeFj0GUHsJvL-Vbx-Rk5tw","la